    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/aebb83690eae24652ec82873ec601a39.poster.avif?t=1748677045\" width=620 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/aebb83690eae24652ec82873ec601a39.webm?t=1748677045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relax, Rescue, and Play \u2014 A Cozy Card Adventure Awaits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animal Hearts: A Card Quest</strong> is a charming and relaxing solo card game designed to help you chill and relax with pastel colors and pleasant music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cozy quest begins with a simple mission: <strong>rescue cute animal friends trapped in cages</strong> across mysterious lands. As you progress through beautifully illustrated islands, you'll unlock new challenges, adorable characters, and unexpected surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/79b1ff8f5e44ce3a2379e5a300d1def9.poster.avif?t=1748677045\" width=589 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/79b1ff8f5e44ce3a2379e5a300d1def9.webm?t=1748677045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/ff6b487e61d9886780b0f112aadb1095.poster.avif?t=1748677045\" width=598 height=165 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/ff6b487e61d9886780b0f112aadb1095.webm?t=1748677045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/433ad93bd1a0f7cf5e6dd10b2382d31a.poster.avif?t=1748677045\" width=578 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/433ad93bd1a0f7cf5e6dd10b2382d31a.webm?t=1748677045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/c7ab90de73edeaeb14fce8179afa0cfa.poster.avif?t=1748677045\" width=578 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667550/extras/c7ab90de73edeaeb14fce8179afa0cfa.webm?t=1748677045\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of cozy card games, casual players looking to relax, or anyone who loves animals and charming adventures.</p>",
